INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('ComposioHQ/awesome-claude-skills', 'awesome-claude-skills', 'ComposioHQ', 'awesome-claude-skills', 'official', 'awesome-claude-skills ComposioHQ awesome-claude-skills official agent-skills ai-agents antigravity automation claude claude-code codex composio cursor gemini-cli mcp rube saas skill workflow-automation awesome-claude-skills provides a curated list of resources and tools for customizing Claude AI workflows, benefiting developers and automation specialists. It supports various technologies, including gemini-cli, mcp, and rube. Awesome Claude Skills 是一个精心策划的资源集合，专门为开发人员提供Claude Skills、工具和工作流自动化解决方案。包含MCP协议实现、Composio集成、Cursor编辑器扩展等专业技术资源 Awesome Claude Skills は開発者向けに厳選されたClaude SkillsとAIエージェントカスタマイズリソースです。MCPプロトコル、Composio連携、Cursorエディタ拡張などの技術ツールとワークフロー自動化ソリューションを提供 Awesome Claude Skills는 개발자를 위한 Claude Skills 및 AI 에이전트 커스터마이징 리소스의 큐레이티드 목록입니다. MCP 프로토콜, Composio 연동, Cursor 편집기 확장 등의 기술 도구와 워크플로우 자동화 솔루션을 포함 awesome-claude-skills es una colección curada de recursos técnicos para personalizar workflows de Claude AI. Incluye herramientas MCP, integraciones Comosio, automatización con Claude Code y ejemplos de agentes IA. awesome-claude-skills est une collection organisée de ressources techniques pour personnaliser les workflows Claude AI. Comprend outils MCP, intégrations Comosio, automatisation avec Claude Code et exemples d''agents IA. awesome-claude-skills ist eine kuratierte Sammlung technischer Ressourcen zur Anpassung von Claude AI Workflows. Enthält MCP Tools, Comosio Integrationen, Automatisierung mit Claude Code und KI Agenten Beispiele. O awesome-claude-skills é uma lista curada de recursos e ferramentas para personalizar fluxos de trabalho de IA com Claude awesome-claude-skills - это отобранная коллекция ресурсов и инструментов для кастомизации рабочих процессов ИИ с помощью Claude awesome-claude-skills هو قائمة مركبة من الموارد والأدوات لتعزيز سير العمل التلقائي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مع Claude how to use awesome-claude-skills awesome-claude-skills alternative awesome-claude-skills setup guide what is awesome-claude-skills awesome-claude-skills vs claude-code awesome-claude-skills install customizable ai workflows claude ai automation gemini-cli tutorials Claude Skills 开发指南 MCP协议实现教程 Composio集成Claude Cursor编辑器AI扩展 Claude工作流自动化 AI代理技能定制 Antigravity自动化示例 Gemini CLI工具使用 Supports automation using gemini-cli and mcp Utilizes codex for customizable AI workflows Integrates with composio for enhanced workflow automation Includes resources for antigravity and cursor customization Compatible with SaaS applications and rube technology awesome-claude-skills is a collection of curated resources, tools, and workflows for customizing and automating Claude AI tasks, utilizing technologies like codex and composio.');
